# Exact gitleaks fingerprints, `<commit>:<path>:<rule>:<line>`, and nothing broader.
#
# A fingerprint names one finding in one commit. It cannot exempt the same text in any
# other commit, any other line or any other file, so the tip and every future commit are
# still scanned in full — narrower than `.config/gitleaks.toml`'s `commits` allowlist,
# which exempts every line of a commit. `scripts/static-analysis-config-check.mjs` refuses
# an entry that is not of exactly this shape, so this file cannot grow a path- or
# rule-wide exemption.
#
